OL,3,AFive men arrested near RAF Fairford on
OL,4,Asuspicion of terror offences were UK
OL,5,Anationals from London, police say
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, a farmer who called 999 in the
OL,8,Fearly hours of Sunday when she saw "a
OL,9,Flarge group of hooded and masked men"
OL,10,Fsaid she "foiled" their plans
OL,12,FBut Defence Secretary Wes Streeting
OL,13,Fsaid she only had a "partial picture",
OL,14,Fwhile declining to speculate on
OL,15,Fpossible Iranian links
OL,17,FThe RAF base is used by the US
OL,18,Fmilitary. President Trump said the US
OL,19,Fhad the five men "under view for a long
OL,20,Ftime, and we got them"
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
